{"3531730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hotel Sim", "steam_appid": 3531730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Hotel Sim</strong>, a quirky hotel management game where you start from nothing and build your way up to a 5-star empire… or watch it all go up in flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of a run-down roadside motel, furnish every room however you like, attract increasingly demanding (and sometimes bizarre) guests, and climb the ranks to become a luxury hotel tycoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned ! Not every guest is there to relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From squatters and thieves to full-blown room fires, chaos is always just a check-in away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Between strategic planning, on-the-fly crisis management, and a few shady side hustles, Hotel Sim is an unpredictable and addictive ride.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏨 <strong>Hotel Growth &amp; Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in a rundown motel on the edge of nowhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your rooms, improve your services, and earn better guest ratings to unlock new milestones. Once you reach 3 stars, you’ll move into a proper city hotel with more space, better design, and higher expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/9db2a60a46bb6e9701a8e8b4b6e9a01d.poster.avif?t=1758093006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/9db2a60a46bb6e9701a8e8b4b6e9a01d.webm?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/9db2a60a46bb6e9701a8e8b4b6e9a01d.mp4?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛋️ <strong>Fully Customizable Room </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design each room by placing any furniture you want wherever you like : beds, toilets, TVs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have complete freedom to arrange your rooms as you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/880702afd544f347ce28de26d062f650.poster.avif?t=1758093006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/880702afd544f347ce28de26d062f650.webm?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/880702afd544f347ce28de26d062f650.mp4?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>Dynamic Rating System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer reviews directly influence the type of guests who will choose to stay at your hotel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A low rating (under 2 stars) will attract questionable guests like squatters or delinquents, while high ratings draw wealthier and pickier clientele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reputation affects your income, opportunities, and long-term success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/0c2bf5a0b5c4959445c4de4f64a3ad8e.poster.avif?t=1758093006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/0c2bf5a0b5c4959445c4de4f64a3ad8e.webm?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/0c2bf5a0b5c4959445c4de4f64a3ad8e.mp4?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>Random Events</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected. Some guests may refuse to leave, others might steal your furniture, and occasionally, a fire might break out in a room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These events add chaos and variety, pushing you to adapt quickly and keep your hotel running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/8bbff71fe1ba6b37305119392669f9fb.poster.avif?t=1758093006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/8bbff71fe1ba6b37305119392669f9fb.webm?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/8bbff71fe1ba6b37305119392669f9fb.mp4?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💵 <strong>Extra Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your profits with vending machines or spice things up by installing special &quot;printers&quot; to generate off-the-books income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These under-the-table activities can help you grow faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/64ecf9e9a1a9293ea3b314f13378e6ae.poster.avif?t=1758093006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/64ecf9e9a1a9293ea3b314f13378e6ae.webm?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/64ecf9e9a1a9293ea3b314f13378e6ae.mp4?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Hotel Sim</strong>, a quirky hotel management game where you start from nothing and build your way up to a 5-star empire… or watch it all go up in flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of a run-down roadside motel, furnish every room however you like, attract increasingly demanding (and sometimes bizarre) guests, and climb the ranks to become a luxury hotel tycoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned ! Not every guest is there to relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From squatters and thieves to full-blown room fires, chaos is always just a check-in away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Between strategic planning, on-the-fly crisis management, and a few shady side hustles, Hotel Sim is an unpredictable and addictive ride.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏨 <strong>Hotel Growth &amp; Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in a rundown motel on the edge of nowhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your rooms, improve your services, and earn better guest ratings to unlock new milestones. Once you reach 3 stars, you’ll move into a proper city hotel with more space, better design, and higher expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/9db2a60a46bb6e9701a8e8b4b6e9a01d.poster.avif?t=1758093006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/9db2a60a46bb6e9701a8e8b4b6e9a01d.webm?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/9db2a60a46bb6e9701a8e8b4b6e9a01d.mp4?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛋️ <strong>Fully Customizable Room </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design each room by placing any furniture you want wherever you like : beds, toilets, TVs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have complete freedom to arrange your rooms as you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/880702afd544f347ce28de26d062f650.poster.avif?t=1758093006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/880702afd544f347ce28de26d062f650.webm?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/880702afd544f347ce28de26d062f650.mp4?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>Dynamic Rating System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer reviews directly influence the type of guests who will choose to stay at your hotel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A low rating (under 2 stars) will attract questionable guests like squatters or delinquents, while high ratings draw wealthier and pickier clientele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reputation affects your income, opportunities, and long-term success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/0c2bf5a0b5c4959445c4de4f64a3ad8e.poster.avif?t=1758093006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/0c2bf5a0b5c4959445c4de4f64a3ad8e.webm?t=1758093006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531730/extras/0c2bf5a0b5c4959445c4de4f64a3ad8e.mp4?t=1758093006\"